---
layout: base.njk
metaTitle: "CODACON — AI Security Consulting & Applied AI Engineering"
title: "Build capability. Keep control."
description: "CODACON designs and secures AI systems for organizations where privacy, resilience, and accountability matter. AI security consulting, cloud security, DevSecOps, and AI governance."
---

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Organization",
  "name": "{{ site.legalName }}",
  "url": "{{ site.url }}",
  "description": "{{ description }}",
  "foundingDate": "{{ site.foundingDate }}",
  "founder": {
    "@type": "Person",
    "name": "{{ site.author.name }}"
  },
  "contactPoint": {
    "@type": "ContactPoint",
    "email": "{{ site.contactEmail }}",
    "contactType": "sales"
  }
}
</script>
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  "itemListElement": [{
    "@type": "ListItem",
    "position": 1,
    "name": "Home",
    "item": "{{ site.url }}"
  }]
}
</script>

<div class="hero">
  <p class="hero-eyebrow">AI Security &amp; Applied AI Engineering</p>
  <h1>Build capability. Keep control.</h1>
  <p class="hero-body">CODACON designs and secures AI systems for organizations where privacy, resilience, and accountability matter. We turn high-value workflows into operational capability your team can own, trust, and improve.</p>
  <div class="hero-ctas">
    <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn--primary">Discuss a critical workflow</a>
    <a href="/capabilities/" class="btn">See how we work</a>
  </div>
</div>

<p class="trust-line">Practitioner-led. AWS and Azure. Built for regulated environments. Based in Canada. English and French.</p>

<div class="card-grid">
  <div class="card">
    <h3>Build</h3>
    <p>AI systems and automation designed for production — not demos. We architect, build, and harden AI-driven workflows so your team ships capability that holds up under real conditions and real scrutiny.</p>
    <a href="/capabilities/#build" class="card-link">How we build &rarr;</a>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <h3>Secure</h3>
    <p>AI and cloud security grounded in architecture, not checklists. Threat modeling, infrastructure hardening, incident response — the work that makes systems trustworthy before an auditor asks.</p>
    <a href="/capabilities/#secure" class="card-link">How we secure &rarr;</a>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <h3>Govern</h3>
    <p>Governance and resilience frameworks that engineers can execute and leadership can defend. Policy as code, risk accountability, and compliance posture that reflects what actually runs.</p>
    <a href="/capabilities/#govern" class="card-link">How we govern &rarr;</a>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="section">
  <h2>Field Notes</h2>
  <ul class="post-list">
    {%- for post in collections.posts | limit(3) %}
    <li>
      <div class="post-meta">
        <time datetime="{{ post.date | dateISO }}">{{ post.date | dateDisplay }}</time>
        <span>{{ post.templateContent | readingTime }} read</span>
      </div>
      <h3><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h3>
      <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
    </li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
  <p><a href="/insights/">All field notes &rarr;</a></p>
</section>

{% if products | length %}
<section class="section">
  <h2>Products</h2>
  <p>Open tools and tested configurations we use in client work and release publicly.</p>
  <div class="card-grid">
    {%- for product in products | limit(3) %}
    <div class="product-card">
      <span class="status-badge{% if product.status == 'Private beta' %} status-badge--beta{% elif product.status == 'Research' %} status-badge--research{% endif %}">{{ product.status }}</span>
      <h3>{{ product.name }}</h3>
      <p>{{ product.outcome }}</p>
      <p class="product-audience">{{ product.audience }}</p>
      {% if product.url != "TODO" %}<a href="{{ product.url }}" class="card-link">{{ product.cta }} &rarr;</a>{% else %}<span class="card-link" style="opacity:0.4">URL pending</span>{% endif %}
    </div>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

<div class="final-cta">
  <h2>Bring us one consequential workflow.</h2>
  <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn--primary">Start a conversation</a>
</div>
